  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00958",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "陈词滥调！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Cliches!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00958",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "……喔，陈词滥调，可以……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "... Oh, cliches are fine ...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00958",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "临死之际，什么个性，净扯淡，什么忙也帮不了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "At the moment of death, all that talk about individuality is sheer nonsense and cannot help at all.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00958",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "被模具压成各式造型的粗点心似的活法也可以，无论如何想活下去！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Even a life like cheap sweets pressed into shapes by a mold would be fine; no matter what, I want to live!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00958",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "……现在已经埋到胸口了，埋到下巴了，慢慢接近鼻子底下了……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "... Now it has already buried me up to the chest, up to the chin, slowly drawing near beneath my nose ...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00958",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "够啦够啦！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Enough, enough!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00958",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "已经足够了！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It is already enough!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
